    {
      "text": "The relationship is \\(y^3 \\sqrt[3]{z}=k\\).  \nUsing \\(y=2, z=1\\): \\(8\\cdot 1=k\\), so \\(k=8\\).  \n\nWhen \\(y=4\\):  \n\\[\n64\\sqrt[3]{z}=8 \\implies \\sqrt[3]{z}=\\frac18\n\\]\nCubing:\n\\[\nz=\\left(\\frac18\\right)^3=\\frac1{512}\n\\]\n\nThe answer is \\(\\frac{1}{512}\\)",
